From b6d9a0b08bf4fe870f963528b14e968e205aec99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?=E5=AD=90=E8=AA=89?= <anbaiqiang@wenshu.local>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 14:07:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 164/168] =?UTF-8?q?fix(wenshu):=20R131=20-=20=E5=8A=A0=20c?=
 =?UTF-8?q?oncat-map=20devDep=20(electron-builder=20=E7=BC=BA=20@electron/?=
 =?UTF-8?q?asar=20peer=20dep)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

[真根因]
- 装 user 跑 wenshu update --yes 12:34 -> 卡 'Cannot find module concat-map'
- @electron/asar 3.4.1 依赖 brace-expansion + minimatch + concat-map (peer dep)
- pnpm install 不自动装 concat-map (因为 brace-expansion 不会 declared concat-map peer)
- 装包器 binary 跑 pnpm dist:mac -> app-builder-lib @electron/asar 找不到 concat-map

[R131 修法]
- apps/desktop/package.json devDependencies 加 concat-map ^0.0.2
- 装包器 binary 跑 pnpm install 时自动装 concat-map
- @electron/asar/node_modules/concat-map 链到 仓根 node_modules/concat-map (pnpm pnp 自动)

[验证]
- py_compile exit 0
- pnpm dist:mac exit 0 (build .app + .zip + .dmg 跑通)
- DMG 342.2 MB
- venv .app + DMG 拷 Downloads

[装 user 必走]
- 跑新 DMG 装包器 ~/Downloads/WenShu-Setup.dmg (md5 53c925cd)
- 跑新 APP DMG ~/Downloads/文枢-0.1.0-arm64.dmg (md5 bc34351c)
- 跑 wenshu update --yes (R130 自动化 Electron + dmgbuild 下载)
- 验 4 件 + 反馈

[版本号]
0.1.0 (装 user 拍 "基础版本不 bump")
